        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Image edit, with the Image References Manager\n\n1. Upload the picture to edit first. It becomes `<Picture 1>` and its tile says **edit target**. Every image after it is a reference, `<Picture 2>` onward.\n2. Wrong order? Click the target chip on any other tile to make it the image to edit, or select a tile and use the arrow keys.\n3. Type the edit in the prompt box. With `prompt_provider` on `openrouter` or `local` a vision model writes the full MiniMax H3 Image prompt; on `none` your text goes through as it is.\n\nThe output keeps the shape of `<Picture 1>` at about 4 MP."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    }
